      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The case of a 64 years old female patient with chest pain, dizziness and abnormal chest x-ray is presented. The different diagnostic possibilities are discussed. The final assessment in the case was a double radiographic exposure of the chest film confusing the clinical picture."},
